                                "sense_id": "b4896356-841a-3b6b-ba02-1ff1e8382574",
                                "text": "Then did he cast to steale her thence away, / And with him beare where none of her might know: / But all in vaine, for-why he found no way / To enter in […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f420dea2-f3b6-4aa5-ad95-1fd66a8121c9",
                                "sense_id": "b4896356-841a-3b6b-ba02-1ff1e8382574",
                                "text": "But of the day—and of the weeks bygone, and of many other things—this deponent saith nil, whereby and forwhy he is going to bed."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
